{"v":1,"book":"Neh","ch":13,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"On that day they read in the book of Moses in the hearing of the people; and it was found written in it that no Ammonite or Moabite should enter the assembly of God forever,","tok":[{"t":"On that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" they "},{"t":"read","s":["H7121"],"a":[2]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"book","s":["H5612"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"hearing","s":["H0241"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; and it was "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"written","s":["H3789"],"a":[8]},{"t":" in it that no "},{"t":"Ammonite","s":["H5984"],"a":[13]},{"t":" or "},{"t":"Moabite","s":["H4125"],"a":[14]},{"t":" should enter the assembly of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"forever","s":["H5769"],"a":[18]},{"t":","}]},{"n":2,"text":"For they did not meet the children of Israel with bread and water, but hired Balaam against them to curse them; yet our God turned the curse into a blessing.","tok":[{"t":"For they did not meet the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[5]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"bread","s":["H3899"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[7]},{"t":", but "},{"t":"hired","s":["H7936"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Balaam","s":["H1109"],"a":[11]},{"t":" against them to "},{"t":"curse","s":["H7043"],"a":[12]},{"t":" them; yet our "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"turned","s":["H2015"],"a":[13]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"curse","s":["H7045"],"a":[15]},{"t":" into a "},{"t":"blessing","s":["H1293"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"And when they heard the law, they separated all the mixed multitude from Israel.","tok":[{"t":"And when they "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"law","s":["H8451"],"a":[3]},{"t":", they "},{"t":"separated","s":["H0914"],"a":[4]},{"t":" all the mixed "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H6154"],"a":[6]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Now before this, Eliashib the priest, who had been appointed over the chambers of the house of our God, because he was related to Tobiah,","tok":[{"t":"Now "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[0]},{"t":" this, "},{"t":"Eliashib","s":["H0475"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"priest","s":["H3548"],"a":[3]},{"t":", who had been appointed over the "},{"t":"chambers","s":["H3957"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of our "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":", because he was related to "},{"t":"Tobiah","s":["H2900"],"a":[9]},{"t":","}]},{"n":5,"text":"Had prepared for him a large chamber where previously they had put the meal offering, the frankincense, and the vessels, as well as the tithes of the grain, the new wine, and the fresh oil, as commanded for the Levites and the singers and the gatekeepers, and the heave offerings for the priests.","tok":[{"t":"Had "},{"t":"prepared","s":["H6213"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for him a large "},{"t":"chamber","s":["H3957"],"a":[2]},{"t":" where previously they had put the meal offering, the "},{"t":"frankincense","s":["H3828"],"a":[10]},{"t":", and the "},{"t":"vessels","s":["H3627"],"a":[11]},{"t":", as well as the "},{"t":"tithes","s":["H4643"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of the grain, the new "},{"t":"wine","s":["H8492"],"a":[14]},{"t":", and the fresh "},{"t":"oil","s":["H3323"],"a":[15]},{"t":", as "},{"t":"commanded","s":["H4687"],"a":[16]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"Levites","s":["H3881"],"a":[17]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"singers","s":["H7891"],"a":[18]},{"t":" and the gatekeepers, and the heave "},{"t":"offerings","s":["H8641"],"a":[20]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"priests","s":["H3548"],"a":[21]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"But during all this time I was not in Jerusalem, for in the thirty-second year of Artaxerxes the king of Babylon I went to the king; then after some time I asked leave from the king.","t