 its services."}]},{"n":15,"text":"In those days I saw some in Judah treading wine presses on the Sabbath and bringing in heaps of grain and loading them on their donkeys, as well as wine, grapes and figs, and every kind of load, and they were bringing them into Jerusalem on the Sabbath day; and I protested on the day that they sold food.","tok":[{"t":"In those "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" I "},{"t":"saw","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":" some in "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"treading","s":["H1869"],"a":[4]},{"t":" wine "},{"t":"presses","s":["H1660"],"a":[5]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"Sabbath","s":["H7676"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and bringing "},{"t":"in","s":["H0935"],"a":[7]},{"t":" heaps of grain and loading them on their donkeys, as well as "},{"t":"wine","s":["H3196"],"a":[13]},{"t":", "},{"t":"grapes","s":["H6025"],"a":[14]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"figs","s":["H8384"],"a":[15]},{"t":", and every kind of load, and they were bringing them into "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[19]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"Sabbath","s":["H7676"],"a":[21]},{"t":" "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[20]},{"t":"; and I protested on the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[23]},{"t":" that they "},{"t":"sold","s":["H4376"],"a":[24]},{"t":" "},{"t":"food","s":["H6718"],"a":[25]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"And Tyrians who dwelt there were also bringing in fish and every kind of merchandise, and selling it on the Sabbath to the children of Judah and in Jerusalem.","tok":[{"t":"And Tyrians who "},{"t":"dwelt","s":["H3427"],"a":[1]},{"t":" there were also bringing in "},{"t":"fish","s":["H1709"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and every kind of merchandise, and selling it on the "},{"t":"Sabbath","s":["H7676"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and in "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Then I contended with the nobles of Judah and said to them, What is this evi